 567:Generated_Source\PSoC5/Filter.c **** *  Configures the DFB coherency register for each of the staging and holding 
 568:Generated_Source\PSoC5/Filter.c **** *  registers. Allows multiple registers with the same configuration to be set 
 569:Generated_Source\PSoC5/Filter.c **** *  at the same time. This API should be used when the coherency of the staging 
 570:Generated_Source\PSoC5/Filter.c **** *  and holding register of a channel is different. 
